{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNNYAN is a falling puzzle and merge game to enjoy together with cute cats living on the Nyanten Island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to play with simple controls, but with the addition of original rules, a new puzzle experience awaits you, requiring a deep strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the game in your favorite style, whether you want to master the game by yourself or have a lot of fun playing against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Mode Descriptions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNYAN by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is a mode in which you can aim for a high score by yourself. Compete with players from all over the world in the online ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Single Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is an offline-only mode where up to 4 players can enjoy cooperative or competitive play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Simple Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Send \u201cObstacle Bone\u201d to your opponent by erasing \u201cPUNYAN\u201d! The winner is the one who doesn't spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d or \u201cObstacle Bone\u201d until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Rotation Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The winner is the one who takes turns and does not spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d until the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Coop Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Each player fires a \u201cPUNYAN\u201d! Players can cooperate with each other and aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0NonStop Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The winner is the one who does not spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d until the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Speed Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The first player to create the largest \u201cPUNYAN\u201d on the island, \u201cTENOU\u201d, the fastest wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0PICTURE BOOK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is an illustrated book function that provides information on the 10 attractive PUNYAN characters that live on Nyanten Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that the time you spend with the PUNYAN will be a new pleasure for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fusion1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/a7c9d27d1cbb7a085f08ab398bb0de05180acb15.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/382b629c57f1400d35a4830f25e02ca9913605af.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/b7428cfb94941c33bd3b8dc66d368d43246010ef.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/bedb6ff8e387b223f6cb187adfdf911cfa0653bd.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/cd307c7a5b2574c2aa9fdabe3ca82801403b6d2e.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/06961db040c4b25233572e32eba56bf426f97266.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/e0479cd9d4c0fbf5af1bce3a983c0426ec885839.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/1967a5bd881123465d8634905891aa8dc26fdb6f.jpg"},{"name":"Fusion9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/ab8e0107c8c33434012c6cd49feacf4034aa9cda.jpg"},{"name":"Solo3000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3426020/9c2af6a3055f18753b5a22b839a2ede5a5038cb8.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun